invariant: INV-62
file: pem_files.c
catches: pem_files_mldsa_test
reason: ch_mldsa_key_from_pem takes the both form without its check that
  the file's expanded key is the seed's, so a file whose two halves
  disagree reads. bin/pem_files_mldsa_test changes one byte of OpenSSL's
  expanded key and requires CH_EINVAL.

--- old
             (expanded == NULL || ct_memeq(expanded, sk, MLDSA87_SK_LEN) == 1) &&
--- new
             (expanded == NULL || ct_memeq(expanded, expanded, MLDSA87_SK_LEN) == 1) &&
